{"steam_appid":3201830,"steam_name":"The Hidden Scrolls","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201830/1884153359/721d5cb54bde9282005cf768f7e815bb44ac301d/1784136646/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784167177","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257377704/fae66d446e1c59aa89390d18635cbaef00c7f1e9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784167177","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/6157e41309b7dc3db9a86098420a3b49643c493b/ss_6157e41309b7dc3db9a86098420a3b49643c493b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785826029","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/8ea1599fd0bb7525f3644f8421bb2501352c5737/ss_8ea1599fd0bb7525f3644f8421bb2501352c5737.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785826029","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/5a19110ed0428b7f7ff828fa6d75fd738c5b4a11/ss_5a19110ed0428b7f7ff828fa6d75fd738c5b4a11.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785826029","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/cdbd8b52f109221a704e9d26421200019e1c5778/ss_cdbd8b52f109221a704e9d26421200019e1c5778.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785826029","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/26555896ad740dd6bd3072df174578e8cf548e1d/ss_26555896ad740dd6bd3072df174578e8cf548e1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785826029"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/9a67622a2bb66aa42f8b34010570ba42.avif?t=1785826029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras_big/9a67622a2bb66aa42f8b34010570ba42.webp?t=1785826029 width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/bb04d3070220e5c64076fa55d90a6ee6.avif?t=1785826029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras_big/bb04d3070220e5c64076fa55d90a6ee6.webp?t=1785826029 width=1560 height=239 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a Spring and Autumn fantasy realm where ink-wash brushstrokes meet the texture of oil painting. Mist-shrouded peaks, abandoned bamboo paths, desolate ancient ruins… Five distinct regions await your exploration. Battle monsters, bandits, and fallen souls twisted by obsession into demonic forms. Collect cryptic bamboo slips to piece together the truth behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/ac20f8eeded461f64097ddcb210f03f6.poster.avif?t=1785826029\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/ac20f8eeded461f64097ddcb210f03f6.webm?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/ac20f8eeded461f64097ddcb210f03f6.mp4?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/8d313c7c22e8654ac5142548abd93b57.avif?t=1785826029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras_big/8d313c7c22e8654ac5142548abd93b57.webp?t=1785826029 width=1560 height=239 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your expedition party by freely combining retainers from 13 classes: Swordsmen, Physicians, Shamans, Drum Warriors and more. Combat goes beyond positioning; skill synergies are key. Even with the same lineup, drastically different playstyles emerge, ready to take on 60 mystical beasts and over 10 uniquely designed bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/de4851fce678196be4614d81bb890992.poster.avif?t=1785826029\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/de4851fce678196be4614d81bb890992.webm?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/de4851fce678196be4614d81bb890992.mp4?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/a3260ff62fc39b8a8fc7b5ee6139b0e5.avif?t=1785826029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras_big/a3260ff62fc39b8a8fc7b5ee6139b0e5.webp?t=1785826029 width=1560 height=239 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle tests not only your tactics, but also your retainers' minds. They may grow bolder in desperation, or break down and flee from terror. Fallen characters face permanent death. When a companion is lost in the wilds, will you risk your entire party to bring them back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/eee47ae8135aa32c59768dc3e5e22daa.poster.avif?t=1785826029\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/eee47ae8135aa32c59768dc3e5e22daa.webm?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/eee47ae8135aa32c59768dc3e5e22daa.mp4?t=1785826029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/13ae642817f722e7c1774969021d461f.avif?t=1785826029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras_big/13ae642817f722e7c1774969021d461f.webp?t=1785826029 width=1560 height=239 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each expedition, return to town to rest, develop, and recruit talent. Construct various buildings and enlist legendary figures from the Spring and Autumn era: Lord Xinling helps you recruit capable retainers to fill vacancies, Yan Ying boosts morale through lectures, and Gan Jiang forges peerless weapons for you. Through rituals and research, strengthen your forces, enhance your gear, and prepare for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f7f9a50df07475740333659d171d1670.avif?t=1785826029\" width=1486 height=506 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4-Generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4-Generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Red Dragon Studio"],"publishers":["2P Games"],"release_date":"Jul 15, 2026"}